  <main>
    <section class="hero" style="border-top:none; padding-top:70px;">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="eyebrow">Building in public — channel launching soon</div>
        <h1>The <span class="g1">dollar</span> moves first. <span class="g2">Gold</span> confirms. <span class="g3">Bitcoin</span> follows.</h1>
        <p class="lede">A trading channel built on intermarket macro reads and a real, screen-recorded track record — not signals, not hype. I trade what I teach, and you watch the trade happen.</p>
        <div class="hero-ctas">
          <a href="#notify" class="btn btn-primary">Get notified at launch →</a>
          <a href="https://shariefvp.github.io/myportfolio/#markets" class="btn btn-ghost">View my trading credentials</a>
        </div>

        <div class="chartcard">
          <div class="chartcard-head">
            <h3>Intermarket lead–lag, illustrative</h3>
            <div class="legend">
              <span><i style="background:var(--rose)"></i>DXY</span>
              <span><i style="background:var(--gold)"></i>Gold</span>
              <span><i style="background:var(--teal)"></i>BTC</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 760 220" role="img" aria-label="Illustrative chart showing DXY declining first, followed by Gold rising, followed by Bitcoin rising">
            <line x1="0" y1="55" x2="760" y2="55" stroke="#1a1e24" stroke-width="1"/>
            <line x1="0" y1="110" x2="760" y2="110" stroke="#1a1e24" stroke-width="1"/>
            <line x1="0" y1="165" x2="760" y2="165" stroke="#1a1e24" stroke-width="1"/>
            <path class="chart-path path-dxy" d="M10,70 C120,72 180,90 260,130 C340,168 420,178 520,182 C600,184 680,183 750,183"/>
            <path class="chart-path path-gold" d="M10,150 C120,150 200,148 280,142 C380,134 440,110 520,88 C610,64 680,52 750,46"/>
